00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:30.270
building, but
once you get to scale, once you're working

71
00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:32.930
with other team members
and continuing to work

72
00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:36.930
and move forward, you want
to have a tool that's going to

